# Chapter 13, worked example: the financial @functions agree with each
# other (two decimal places)
do /wgff2~
A1 Principal
B1 10000
A2 Rate
B2 .01
A3 Months
B3 36
A4 Payment
B4 @PMT(B1,B2,B3)
A5 Check
B5 @PV(B4,B2,B3)
A6 Savings
B6 @FV(100,.005,120)
A7 Months
B7 @TERM(100,.005,20000)
show B4
show B5
show B6
show B7
